**Cafe owners** are considering [raising menu prices](https://news.example.org/REDACTED "Cafes Weigh Price Increase") next quarter, a trade group said, as bean costs climb. A regional roaster [reported record sales](https://news.example.org/REDACTED "Roaster Reports Record Sales") despite the pressure.

