### Deep Dive: Why the Bean Market Is Tight

In one valley, a family farm that has grown coffee for generations is [weighing its future after a poor harvest](https://news.example.org/REDACTED "Farm Faces Hard Choices").

- **In the north**, growers are calling on officials to act over rising costs.
- **Across the region**, buyers are paying more for beans after two weak seasons.
- **Shipping rates** have climbed sharply; [freight costs hit a record](https://news.example.org/REDACTED "Freight Costs Climb") last week.
- **With an election** coming, the issue is moving up the agenda.

